1
00:00:00,843 --> 00:00:04,093
- If something goes wrong, then what?
- It'll just be Sheldon and me...

2
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:06,764
(Amy:)...going on a double date
with Howard and Bernadette.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,480
(Bernadette:)Sure. We'd love that.

4
00:00:11,729 --> 00:00:15,019
(Bernadette:)Change your clothes,
we got a lot riding on this.

5
00:00:18,987 --> 00:00:20,527
Hmm.

6
00:00:21,406 --> 00:00:26,656
(Sheldon:)I want to build a road,
but I need wood.

7
00:00:27,495 --> 00:00:30,245
(Sheldon:)Do either of you fellows have wood?

8
00:00:35,461 --> 00:00:37,381
(Sheldon:)I don't understand the laughter.

9
00:00:39,048 --> 00:00:42,338
(Sheldon:)The object of Settlers of Catan
is to build roads and settlements...

10
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:47,140
(Sheldon:)...to do so requires wood.
Now, I have sheep, I need wood.

11
00:00:49,559 --> 00:00:51,309
(Sheldon:)Who has wood for my sheep?

12
00:00:54,939 --> 00:00:57,029
(Leonard:)Okay. How do I look?

13
00:00:57,233 --> 00:00:59,693
(Howard:)More to the point,
why are you doing this?

